<!-- ── OUR STORY ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section id="story">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-label">How it began</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Our <em>Love Story</em></h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Every love story is beautiful — ours is our favourite. Here are the moments that led us here.</p>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-card reveal">
        <div class="timeline-icon">🌟</div>
        <div class="timeline-date">February — A Thursday</div>
        <div class="timeline-title">How We Met</div>
        <div class="timeline-subcard">
          <div class="timeline-subtitle">His POV</div>
          <p class="timeline-text">I got her number from her sister that fateful day. She posted her picture for her birthday on WhatsApp status.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">Something in me said — call, don't text. So I did.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">She picked up. I said, &ldquo;Hello, this is Goodness.&rdquo;</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">We talked. Just like that. I remember thinking — this is easy. Not in a careless way. In a rare way. The kind of easy that you don't manufacture. Those kairos moments you don't plan for.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">I called the next day. Not because I had a plan. Just because I wanted to.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">Those calls became our thing. Even when everyone was in bed, we'd just talk. Work dramas, random thoughts, aspirations. I was learning her without even trying. And somewhere in those midnight conversations, without making any announcements about it, I knew she was going to be important to me.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">When we finally met in person it confirmed what I already felt. She was exactly herself. No performance. Just her. And that peace — that's the thing I can't fully explain. Being around her just settles something in me.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">There were beautiful seasons. There were hard ones too. But God kept showing up in the middle of all of it, threading things together in ways none of us could have scripted.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">When it was time, I said it plainly. No games. No hints. Just this is who I am, this is what I want, and I want it with you.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">She said yes. And honestly, everything since has just felt like grace.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">From a birthday call I almost didn't make to a lifetime I can't imagine any other way.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">God can be trusted to finish what he starts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-subcard">
          <div class="timeline-subtitle">Her POV</div>
          <p class="timeline-text">It’s a special Thursday evening, sometime in February, which was my birthday. I was receiving calls from family and friends, with gifts. Then my phone rings and a deep voice says &ldquo;Hello, this is Goodness.&rdquo; And I was thinking &ldquo;Goodness? That’s a name, not a greeting 😂&rdquo;</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">But then we talk. And talk. About random things, real things, dreams. No awkward silences, just… ease. The next day he calls again. Then again. Those short “birthday check-ins” turned into our daily 12am conversations. Months of just getting to know each other’s hearts before he ever asked me out.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">Later on, our online conversations led to us meeting physically now and then through our busy schedules, and it’s been wonderful.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">Then he finally said his intentions straight, no games. Just honest and safe at the same time.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">There were sweet moments. There were ups and downs. But through it all, God kept weaving us together.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">A year later, heart pounding as he proposed. From “this is Goodness” to “will you marry me” — and I gave a sweet “yes”.</p>
          <p class="timeline-text">Now by His grace, we’re becoming one in the love. A love that starts with a birthday call and ends at the altar… God is really wonderful.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-card reveal">
          <div class="timeline-icon">🥂</div>
          <div class="timeline-date">November 20, 2026</div>
          <div class="timeline-title">The Wedding (Both Ceremonies)</div>
          <p class="timeline-text">And now, surrounded by everyone we love, we begin forever. Ondo Town, Nigeria — November 20, 2026. Both the Traditional (8:00 AM) and White ceremonies will take place on this day. We can't wait to celebrate with you.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── EVENTS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section id="events">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-label">Save the dates</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">The <em>Celebrations</em></h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Two beautiful ceremonies on November 20, 2026 — Traditional (8:00 AM) and White (11:00 AM). We'd love for you to join us at both.</p>
    <div class="event-cards">
      <div class="event-card reveal">
        <div class="event-card-header">
          <div class="event-type">Day One</div>
          <div class="event-name">White<br>Wedding</div>
        </div>
        <div class="event-card-body">
          <div class="event-detail">
            <span class="event-detail-icon">📅</span>
            <div class="event-detail-text"><strong>November 20, 2026</strong>White Wedding</div>
          </div>
          <div class="event-detail">
            <span class="event-detail-icon">⏰</span>
            <div class="event-detail-text"><strong>11:00 AM</strong>White Wedding Ceremony</div>
          </div>
          <div class="event-detail">
            <span class="event-detail-icon">⛪</span>
            <div class="event-detail-text"><strong>Our Lady of Lourdes Catholic Church</strong>Akinjagunla, Ondo City</div>
          </div>
          <div class="event-detail">
            <span class="event-detail-icon">👗</span>
            <div class="event-detail-text"><strong>Dress Code</strong>Formal / Semi-formal</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cal-actions">
            <a class="btn-cal btn-cal-google" href="#" onclick="addToGoogleCalendar('White Wedding — #MeetTheTemiduns','20261120T100000Z','20261120T130000Z','White Wedding Ceremony — #MeetTheTemiduns','Our Lady of Lourdes Catholic Church, Akinjagunla, Ondo City');return false;">+ Google Calendar</a>
            <button class="btn-cal" onclick="downloadICS('White Wedding — #MeetTheTemiduns','20261120T100000Z','20261120T130000Z','Our Lady of Lourdes Catholic Church\\, Akinjagunla\\, Ondo City','White Wedding Ceremony — #MeetTheTemiduns')">⬇ Apple / Outlook</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="event-card reveal">
        <div class="event-card-header">
          <div class="event-type">Day One</div>
          <div class="event-name">Traditional<br>Wedding</div>
        </div>
        <div class="event-card-body">
          <div class="event-detail">
            <span class="event-detail-icon">📅</span>
            <div class="event-detail-text"><strong>November 20, 2026</strong>Traditional Wedding</div>
          </div>
          <div class="event-detail">
            <span class="event-detail-icon">⏰</span>
            <div class="event-detail-text"><strong>8:00 AM</strong>Start time</div>
          </div>
